    "body": "The use of the word \"Effectively\" leaves ambiguity as to what the true behavior is. If there is actually no ambiguity, then I would not use that word; I would replace it with \"Firstly\" or \"In particular\" or something like that. If there is in fact ambiguity (I do not know) then it's fine to leave it, though a note of clarification may be helpful.",
